# (build 139f) The music after a fight on the jet scooter, and out of a
# dam riding it: Motavia's (Restoration, $82) both times. jet_scooter_dam's
# ride, with `expect song` (the music the sequencer last started) where the
# level changes.
#
# LevelScreen's loads run with the vertical blank on, and VBlankExit runs
# SoundDriverInput every field, so the music LoadLevelData queues is
# started fields before RunObjects runs the scooter's init and its engine
# ($D8, ObjJetSctr_Init) goes into the same one-byte queue. Until 139f the
# port loaded in one tick and the engine overwrote the music: the victory
# music (Movement, $94, which goes on as Movement Ver.2, $96) played on
# after a fight, and Mystery ($88) out of the dam. The owner heard the first.
# Fails on 139e at the first fight's `expect song $82` ("the song playing
# is $96").
start slot 1 routes/saves/jet_scooter.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 89 116
expect song $82                # Restoration: Motavia's, on foot
shot 01_parked
press up                     # the scooter's box stops the step; he turns
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1686          # the note, first boarding only
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $171C          # "Let's get on the jet scooter!"
press c
wait idle                    # riding: the party hidden, the engine on
expect song $82                # boarding changes no music
shot 02_riding
walk up 6
walk left 3
walk up 1
walk left 1
walk up 1
wait idle
walk left 1
wait idle
walk left 1                  # the step begins, and at once:
wait screen battle           # an encounter. On the scooter the roll comes
                             # on the step's first frame, while the
                             # leader's copy is still on the cell it
                             # leaves (loc_11700); BattleScreen saves that
                             # cell, so the step never happens
wait idle                    # FIGHT / STGY
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level            # LevelScreen parks the scooter where the
wait idle                    # fight began; the party is riding again
expect level 0 84 107
expect song $82                # back from the fight: Motavia's again,
                               # not the victory music (Movement, $94)
shot 03_back_on_the_scooter
walk left 3
walk up 24                   # and on the 24th step's first frame
wait screen battle           # (build 129a) another encounter, at 81,84
wait idle
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 81 84         # parked where that fight began, riding
expect song $82                # and after the second fight
walk up 3                    # 2 steps, then the push into the entrance
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $29 47 25
expect song $88                # Mystery, the dam's
shot 04_red_dam_f1
expect no-stderr not ported
expect no-stderr jet scooter
walk down 4                  # out the way we came: loc_28546, back to 81,82
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 81 82         # on the scooter, parked on the arrival cell
expect song $82                # out of the dam riding: Motavia's, not
                               # the dam's
